Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.07,0:19:35.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,广阔无限的蓝天！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:37.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:37.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈卫！
