Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:47.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,给我上！乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.43,0:19:49.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:54.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不会让你妨碍Cure Sky的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:56.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.81,0:19:58.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.52,0:19:59.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.89,0:20:00.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.08,0:20:10.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.17,0:20:16.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
