Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.94,0:20:41.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·棱镜光流
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.94,0:20:41.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Prism Shot
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.62,0:20:49.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.62,0:20:49.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:56.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,太... 太强了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:21:00.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.20,0:21:04.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.83,0:21:06.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:12.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 只是一放松下来 人就软掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.83,0:21:15.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,对... 对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.90,0:21:17.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪我还不成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.41,0:21:20.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你们根本就不用管我这种人...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.44,0:21:23.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:24.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.78,0:21:25.79,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.95,0:21:27.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.30,0:21:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩太厉害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.55,0:21:32.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不能说 “我这种人”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.76,0:21:39.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴可是我亲爱的朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:41.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.23,0:21:48.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.94,0:21:50.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都没事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.87,0:21:52.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶才是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.25,0:21:54.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你保护了小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.77,0:21:55.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.76,0:21:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是刚才那惊天动地的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.81,0:22:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我当成耳旁风 当成过眼云烟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.24,0:22:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看样子是办不到了...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.07,0:22:04.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-啊... 啊哈哈哈哈...   {\3c&HA384FB&\4c&HCAB8FF&}-啊... 啊哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.55,0:22:08.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Prism哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.55,0:22:08.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,960)}棱镜愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.25,0:22:12.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家试着跟我一起跳舞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.33,0:23:48.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,现在开始要好好努力了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.71,0:23:50.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 请多关照！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.32,0:23:51.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是... 是...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.66,0:23:52.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.95,0:23:53.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.14,0:23:55.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,让我一个人战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.07,0:23:57.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.42,0:23:59.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.42,0:23:59.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:03.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,手牵起了手！我们的新招！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.28,0:01:48.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.49,0:01:54.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:59.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:07.35,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.55,0:02:12.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:16.74,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:18.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.23,0:02:22.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:27.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:29.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:33.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.05,0:02:37.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.63,0:02:41.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.67,0:02:41.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:43.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:43.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.35,0:02:48.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.97,0:02:53.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:58.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:03.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.86,0:03:06.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:14.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.07,0:22:29.74,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空万里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.74,0:22:34.33,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能实现梦想与心愿的蔚蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.50,0:22:37.08,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打开心中的麦克风
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.08,0:22:38.92,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:41.30,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.76,0:22:44.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.22,0:22:46.18,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能与你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:48.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打开心灵+门扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.93,0:22:51.64,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已经激动到势不可挡!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:53.31,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.44,0:22:55.98,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.09,0:23:02.53,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}还是那条街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.24,0:23:08.36,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那里 这便是奇迹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.36,0:23:10.70,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.41,0:23:15.08,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都过来！传开这韵律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.08,0:23:19.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牵起手 心连起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.33,0:23:25.42,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用温暖的关怀 培育出的勇气 是无穷无穷的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.51,0:23:29.68,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,积极的图标是标记
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:33.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！这海阔天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.85,0:23:37.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们展开翅膀 飞向蓝天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.55,0:23:38.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,连接起人与人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.94,0:23:41.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圆环！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
